# GrokForge — always-on context

- **Stack**: Electron 35 + electron-vite 3, React 19, TS strict, Tailwind, Monaco, Zod, framer-motion, sonner, lucide-react.
- **Processes**: `src/main` (privileged), `src/preload` (bridge `window.electron`), `src/renderer` (React only — no Node APIs).
- **Workspace**: Per-project data in `userData/workspace-projects/<uuid>/` (`app-project-store.ts`); manifest schema in `src/main/manifest.ts`. GrokForge does **not** write `.grokproject.json` into user folders. Changing manifest shape requires Zod + defaults in `app-project-store.ts` + renderer consumers.
- **Dev**: `npm run dev`. Verify typecheck: `npm run typecheck`.
- **Scope discipline**: Voice streaming, deep multi-root FS, git, and agent backends are **incomplete**; extend via IPC + clear types; avoid drive-by refactors unrelated to the task.
- **Work queue**: **TheTaskManager** (`http://localhost:8080/api`, project `grokforge`, prefix `GFAPP`). When marking a story **done / in progress / backlog**, load **`update-task-manager`** (`.cursor/skills/update-task-manager/SKILL.md` or `@update-task-manager`). For renderer/UI work, load **`styleguide-design`** (`.cursor/skills/styleguide-design/SKILL.md` or `@styleguide-design`).
- **Harness program index**: `docs/harness-roadmap.md` (dual-model **102–114**, debt retrospective, eval links); design depth in `docs/i-am-a-harness.md`. For harness/prompt/routing/validation work, follow **`.cursor/rules/agent-harness-engineering.mdc`** (also applies via globs on `agent-*`, plan lifecycle, field reports).
- **Accent theming**: User picks named themes (**Fern**, **Frost**, **Flame** + optional **More**: Fuchsia, Fawn, Flint, Flax, Fog); dark only; stored in renderer `localStorage` (`grokforge.accent`); `data-accent` on `html` + overrides in `src/renderer/src/index.css`. **Settings → Appearance**.
